WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.458 --> 00:00:08.541
What's your problem-

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:10.708
Holly of the Mizumoto syndicate?

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:14.208
I'm Gena of UN's CTAC.

00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:16.583
I need you to cooperate.

00:00:16.666 --> 00:00:19.708
CTAC? What do you want with me?

00:00:19.791 --> 00:00:22.208
You were talking
with the Tanaseda syndicate.

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:25.041
They're under strict CTAC surveillance.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.958
I learned about you
from that communication.

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:31.625
Thought we wouldn't know?

00:00:32.291 --> 00:00:33.583
How careless of you.

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:35.666
As are you.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.166
I'm her babysitter.

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:41.541
Come over here.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.000
Are you a Mizumoto yakuza?

00:00:56.541 --> 00:01:01.708
There's no bigger scum
than gangsters who use children.

00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:48.208
Requesting backup!
Second platoon, come in--

00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:55.708
Get behind me.

00:01:56.708 --> 00:01:57.875
Are they with you?

00:01:58.333 --> 00:01:59.416
What do you think?

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.708
Help...

00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:25.958
A "real death"...

00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:29.500
His digital consciousness
won't be retrievable.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:34.791
His sleeve... it's enhanced for combat.

